CM Stacked 25mm Collinear - LoRa 868MHz
CM Fixed RP card for xnec2c compatibility
CE
# Dipole 1 (Bottom)
GW 1 11 0 0 -0.078 0 0 0.078 0.0125
# Dipole 2 (Top) - Physical spacing ~0.75 wavelength
GW 2 11 0 0 0.182 0 0 0.338 0.0125
GE 0
# TL card: Connects center of GW1 to center of GW2
# -75 ohms forces the 180-degree phase flip needed for horizontal gain
# 0.172m is the electrical 1/2 wave delay
TL 1 6 2 6 -75 0.172
# Source on center segment of bottom dipole
EX 0 1 6 0 1 0
FR 0 100 0 0 800 1
# Fixed RP card: 0 73 73 1000 0 0 5 5 (Removed the trailing 1)
RP 0 73 73 1000 0 0 5 5
EN
